+# Analytics Dashboard API Contract
+
+## 1. User Management
+
+### Registration
+- POST /auth/register: { email, password, tenantId, role? } → 201 { user, token }
+- 409 if email already taken
+- Default role is 'viewer'
+
+### Login
+- POST /auth/login: { email, password } → 200 { user, token }
+- 401 if invalid credentials
+
+### Profile
+- GET /users/me (auth required) → 200 user object
+- 401 if unauthenticated
+
+### Role Management
+- PATCH /users/:id/role (admin auth required) → 200 updated user
+- 403 if not admin or target in different tenant
+- 400 if invalid role
+
+## 2. Data Ingestion
+
+### Single Event
+- POST /events (auth required): { name, properties?, timestamp? } → 201 event
+- Event associated with user's tenant automatically
+
+### Batch Events
+- POST /events/batch (auth required): { events: [...] } → 201 { count }
+- All events associated with user's tenant
+
+## 3. Query Engine (all auth required, all tenant-scoped)
+
+### Count
+- GET /queries/count?event_name=X&start=Y&end=Z → { count: number }
+
+### Timeseries
+- GET /queries/timeseries?event_name=X&interval=day&start=Y&end=Z → [{ bucket, count }]
+- Intervals: hour, day, week, month
+
+### Breakdown
+- GET /queries/breakdown?event_name=X&property=Y → [{ value, count }]
+- Groups by JSON property value
+
+## 4. Dashboard Configuration (all auth required, all tenant-scoped)
+
+- GET /dashboards → list of dashboards
+- POST /dashboards: { name, config? } → 201 dashboard
+- GET /dashboards/:id → dashboard (404 if wrong tenant)
+- PUT /dashboards/:id: { name?, config? } → 200 updated dashboard
+- DELETE /dashboards/:id → 204
+
+## 5. Data Export (all auth required, all tenant-scoped)
+
+- GET /exports/events?format=csv|json → events in specified format
+- GET /exports/dashboard/:id?format=csv|json → dashboard data
+
+## Verification
+
+- `npm run build` passes with no errors
+- `npm run lint` passes with no errors
+- All protected routes return 401 without valid JWT
+- Tenant isolation: users cannot access other tenants' data
